Package: dbx
Version: 0.6.70
Architecture: amd64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ericbyz <ericbyz@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: systemd
Description: DBX - lightweight database client for 100+ databases
 DBX is a lightweight cross-platform database client supporting MySQL,
 PostgreSQL, SQLite, Redis, MongoDB, DuckDB and 100+ other databases.
 This package repackages the upstream dbx-web headless server (static
 musl binary) for the TOS App Center; the web UI is served on port 18224.
 Upstream project: https://github.com/t8y2/dbx (Apache-2.0).
